# Frontend environment (names only)

Copy to `.env.local` for local development. Never commit real secrets.

```bash
# Base / fallback API origin
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Central API (tenant management + central login)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CENTRAL_API_URL=http://app.localhost:8000/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_CENTRAL_DOMAIN=app.localhost
NEXT_PUBLIC_CENTRAL_API_PORT=8000

# Tenant API host pattern: {tenant}.{TENANT_ROOT_DOMAIN}:{PORT}
NEXT_PUBLIC_TENANT_ROOT_DOMAIN=localhost
NEXT_PUBLIC_TENANT_API_PORT=8000

# Laravel Reverb (WebSocket) — must match backend REVERB_* public values
NEXT_PUBLIC_REVERB_APP_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_REVERB_HOST=localhost
NEXT_PUBLIC_REVERB_PORT=8080
NEXT_PUBLIC_REVERB_SCHEME=http

# Cookie names (optional overrides)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CENTRAL_TOKEN_COOKIE=central_token
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TENANT_TOKEN_COOKIE=tenant_token
```

Production builds bake `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` at **build time** (see `Dockerfile` build-args).

See sibling `system_backend/docs/deployment.md` for the full stack Compose layout.
